<Base lang="en" title="About — Shinyook"><article class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS SPACE</p><h1>Hello, I’m Shinyook.</h1><p>I write about what I discover while building software, learning new things, and living everyday life.</p><p>Lessons from solving a problem, a subject I want to understand better, a thought I’d like to hold onto. This is a space to collect them, without being tied to a single topic.</p><h2>What you’ll find here</h2><p><strong>Development</strong> — Problems, solutions, and lessons from writing code<br/><strong>Learning</strong> — New ideas and study notes<br/><strong>Life</strong> — Small discoveries in ordinary days<br/><strong>Essays</strong> — Thoughts worth spending more time with</p><p><a href="https://github.com/shinyook">GitHub ↗</a></p></article></Base>
